-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span>；单关系抽象归约系统见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a>。</li>\n<li>工作于ZFC。强、弱正规化见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"251992a231a52348\" href=\"?note=251992a231a52348\" title=\"56-df-strongly-normalizing\">56-df-strongly-normalizing</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"049c0e933557b214\" href=\"?note=049c0e933557b214\" title=\"56-df-weakly-normalizing\">56-df-weakly-normalizing</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,a)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{WNAt}(A,\\to,a)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,a)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{WNAt}(A,\\to,a)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SN}(A,\\to)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{WN}(A,\\to).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SN}(A,\\to)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{WN}(A,\\to).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书p13显式提及选择公理。证明已复核：若某个强正规化元素不能到达正规形，则其每个可达元素至少有一个后继；依赖选择构造无限链，矛盾。全局断言逐点推出；不要求有限分支。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-strongly-normalizing","status":"resolved","id":"251992a231a52348","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","locat