s-wn]]、[[56-thm-confluent-implies-unique-normal-form]]；工作于ZFC。"},{"id":"57919581a5b556fd","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-disjoint-union]] 的 $\\Sigma_i,R_i,V,T_i,\\to_i$ 及并系统 $\\Sigma,R,T,\\to$；两个函数符号集不交，原分量和混合项的关系分别在各自签名中计算。 $\\mathrm{Convergent}$、$\\mathrm{NF}$ 见 [[56-df-convergent]]、[[56-df-normal-form]]；终止蕴含弱正规化见 [[56-thm-sn-implies-wn]]，两项模块定理见 [[56-thm-disjoint-union-confluence]]、[[56-thm-disjoint-union-weak-normalization]]。$\\to^*$ 为已绑定关系的自反传递闭包。"},{"id":"d344b982e3ec8df3","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["251992a231a52348","049c0e933557b214","89129816153530db"]}